# In-person play (docs/in-person.md): a target in a graveyard is tapped on a tablet, in the list its graveyard pile opens.
# Bot1 Bolts Bot2's Tarmogoyf as in in-person-lightning-bolt-aimed-from-the-tablets-kills-tarmogoyf, then casts Reanimate
# at the Goyf in Bot2's graveyard - the pile tapped on Bot2's half of a tablet, the Goyf tapped in it. At a table it is
# the position the in-person browser tests play, and the script checks that each tap made the answer it means.
#
# Reanimate puts the Goyf onto the battlefield under Bot1's control and Bot1 loses life equal to its mana value, 2. With
# Lightning Bolt (an instant) and Reanimate (a sorcery) in the graveyards, Tarmogoyf is 2/3 (CR 604.3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Swamp
Lightning Bolt
Reanimate
Mountain x23

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Tarmogoyf
Forest x25

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Tarmogoyf.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Tarmogoyf)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Bot2.Graveyard.Tarmogoyf)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard = Reanimate; Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Tarmogoyf.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Tarmogoyf.Toughness = 3
